From fe84579bf46eb345191b64a2860e00ca8eb96a9e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christian Brauner <christian@brauner.io>
Date: Fri, 24 May 2019 12:44:59 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] BACKPORT: arch: wire-up pidfd_open()

This wires up the pidfd_open() syscall into all arches at once.

Signed-off-by: Christian Brauner <christian@brauner.io>
Reviewed-by: David Howells <dhowells@redhat.com>
Reviewed-by: Oleg Nesterov <oleg@redhat.com>
